k_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Opportunity Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><b>Opportunity Attack</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Attack an enemy moving out of reach.</p></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\n<b>Wrenfrew the Barker</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">human</a> noble. He flees the <a href=\"/wiki/High_Hall\" title=\"High Hall\">High Hall</a> upon entering.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Wrenfrew the Barker is a human nobleman who flees the <a href=\"/wiki/High_Hall\" title=\"High Hall\">High Hall</a> when the party approaches the main stairs. He runs downstairs together with six other nameless civilians. It often happens that they run through the fire, burning them alive. Although he has a specific name, Wrenfrew has no special interactions, dialogue or idle banter.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;f